han raw churn history. Failure to converge returns explicit PARTIAL/DEGRADED/UNKNOWN.

## PM-PROJ-009 — Stable Pagination

One stable snapshot/continuation domain, deterministic ordering, stable tie-breaker, explicit snapshot expiry.

## PM-PROJ-010 — Filter/Sort Disclosure

Hidden fields cannot become existence oracles through filtering, sorting, grouping, search indexing, or derived columns.

## PM-PROJ-011 — Tombstone

Disclosure-safe bounded historical projection of a mechanically ended object. Disclosure retraction/source loss never creates a tombstone.

## PM-PROJ-012 — Cross-Projection Consistency

Prime does not imply one atomic whole-Host snapshot. Workload/process/service/hardware/telemetry/transaction/evidence revisions may differ. Relationships can be live, tombstoned, stale, or unresolved.

